## Model card

- **Name:** LongCat 2.5 (no GA model)
- **Short description:** There is no generally-available "LongCat 2.5". Meituan's LongCat API lists only LongCat-2.0 (open-weight, June 2026) and LongCat-2.5-Preview (API-only, 2026-09-25). The GA 2.5 slot is a verified absence.
- **Provider / access:** No GA route. The only 2.5-line route is the preview (`meituan/longcat-2.5-preview`), tracked separately in `model/longcat-2.5-preview/`.
- **Release / knowledge:** None (no GA release).
- **IDs:** none resolve to a GA model. The preview ID is `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview`.
- **Context window:** No GA figure; the preview lists 1,048,576 (1M) with 131,072 max output.
- **Modalities:** No GA model; the preview is text, image in → text out.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-21):** No GA price; the preview is $0.30 in / $1.20 out per 1M, $0.006 cached read, plus a free OpenCode Zen slot.
- **Architecture:** No GA weights, no model card. (The preview is positioned as a 1.6T total / ~48B active multimodal MoE, but Meituan published no benchmarks and no weights.)

