### Notes (why no scores)

- Meituan's LongCat API change log and pricing pages list only LongCat-2.0 and LongCat-2.5-Preview; no GA "LongCat 2.5" product exists. (https://longcat.chat/platform/docs/ChangeLog.html)
- BenchmarkList tracks the preview at **0 benchmark rows** and states Meituan "published no benchmarks for this preview" with no confirmed independent evaluation. (https://benchmarklist.com/models/meituan-longcat-2.5-preview/)
- No source — official or third-party — publishes benchmark numbers under a GA "LongCat 2.5" name. LongCat-2.0's vendor numbers (SWE-bench Pro 59.5, Terminal-Bench 2.1 70.8) belong to the separate `model/longcat-2.0/` folder and must not be attributed here.
- This folder is a negative record documenting the absence; it must not be scaffolded into a scored entry.

No normalized 1–100 scores are assigned.

